At MAX_TABS_PER_SESSION camofox-browser recycles the least-used tab of the
whole userId, whichever task (sessionKey group) holds it: with several
hermes tasks on one context (parallel sessions on the agent's shared
profile), one task opening tabs closed another's page mid-work. The
requesting task's own group goes first; only a task without a tab of its
own still recycles another's (the cap holds either way).
Targets camofox-browser 1.18.1 after ./challenge-wait.patch and
./plugin-tab-access.patch.

